# Copy to .env.e2e and fill in. .env.e2e is gitignored (matches .env* in the
# repo root .gitignore) — never commit it, paste it, or print it.
#
# Used only by the production-safe configs (playwright.pilot.config.ts,
# playwright.production*.config.ts, playwright.p3-verify.config.ts). See
# docs/runbooks/pos-perf-p44-pilot-and-e2e-readiness.md.
#
# Dedicated automation accounts only — never a real person's login. Each
# E2E_*_EMAIL must contain "e2e-smoke" before the @ (e.g. owner+e2e-smoke-admin@…);
# pilot-smoke.spec.ts and deploy-production.yml refuse any other address.
# PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL has no default: set it to https://www.potatorenovare.com
# (or https://potatorenovare.com) for production, or a local origin such as
# http://127.0.0.1:3440 to rehearse against disposable infrastructure.
PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL=
E2E_SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL=
E2E_SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
E2E_SUPERVISOR_EMAIL=
E2E_SUPERVISOR_PASSWORD=
E2E_BRANCH_EMAIL=
E2E_BRANCH_PASSWORD=
#
# The isolated (mutating) suite — playwright.config.ts — does not read this
# file. It defaults to http://localhost:3000, refuses production, and takes a
# remote host only when E2E_ISOLATED_REMOTE_HOST names it exactly.
